  "configuration_id": "config_031",
  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder and imagenet_vit_l image encoder (config_039) achieve the highest accuracy (0.725). This experiment tests the same RNA encoder and multiprofile setting but with resnet50 image encoder instead of imagenet_vit_l. It isolates the impact of image encoder choice while keeping other factors (scvi_n200, multiprofile, avgpool, weighted fusion) constant. This comparison clarifies whether the superior performance in config_039 stems from the image encoder or other components, addressing key uncertainty about the contribution of image data quality."
}

